        <body>
            <div xml:id="d253">

                <pb facs="0325" n="209" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg209"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.51/1232.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-02-19T20:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 19, 1914, 8
                        p.m.</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your February 18, 3 p.m. Insular Bureau will request Vick to make advance of
                    $35,000 as available in fractional amounts if necessary <pb facs="0326" n="210"
                        xml:id="pg210"/> for express purpose of paying consular and diplomtic corps.
                    Such advance to be deducted from Dominican portion of customs.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
